# Built artifacts. Regenerate with:
#   python rag.py build --variant <clean|invisible|visible|legit> [--mode raw|stripped|selective]
# Not tracked because they are 768-dimension vectors that go stale silently the
# moment a corpus file changes, and a stale index produces plausible-looking
# but meaningless rankings. load_index() refuses one built with a different
# embedding model; it cannot detect an edited corpus.
